- Approach: Implement `grid_zero` (clear the `atomic<i32>` `[mass, mom.xyz]` lanes), `p2g` (quadratic-B-spline 4×4×4 scatter via fixed-point `atomicAdd`, APIC affine momentum), `grid_update` (decode `mom/mass`, apply gravity, write grid velocity/displacement), and `g2p` (gather velocity + reconstruct the APIC `B` matrix). Cell-sort particles before `p2g` per KTD6. Wire the four passes into the per-substep loop in `step()`.
- Patterns to follow: `src/solvers/twofield/transfers.wgsl` (P2G affine + clamp, G2P APIC gather), `src/solvers/twofield/common.wgsl:81-147` (grid lanes, `fp_encode`/`fp_decode`, overflow-headroom math), EA SEED `particleToGrid`/`gridToParticle`/`gridUpdate`.
