   403	/// Offline grid-refinement (Richardson/GCI) study — REDUCED form (the prompt sanctions a
   404	/// documented reduced version: 3 resolutions at 2:1 with the observed-order check). One fixed
   405	/// scenario (a settled hydrostatic saturated column), one scalar QoI = the settled water-column
