There is a real GPU counting-sort/reorder implementation in XPBD, but it is tied to neighbor-search payloads and buffer-copy choreography. For PB-MPM P2G atomic locality, the plan should treat reuse as a ported subsystem with explicit passes/bindings/cost, not as a free switch.
