.deliberate/review_prompt.txt:191:- *Crater forms (fresh dry bed):* settle dry bed, pour at the web flow; the central grain-surface percentile ends **below** the rim and below the no-impact baseline (compare `impact_scale==0` vs calibrated in the same test). Grain center vy is clearly negative during early contact. Covers success criterion 1.
