   223	## Scope Boundaries
   224	
   225	In scope: the single-phase PB-MPM water core (transfers, compliant density constraint, BC/restitution), the perf gate + overflow probe, the bounce metric, the candidate-D comparison, the two-velocity cost projection + buffer ledger, the comparison renders, and the documented go/no-go. The contingent coarse pre-pass (U7) is in scope only if measurement triggers it.
